ied\n- [ ] Assumptions checked\n- [ ] Sample size justified (power analysis)\n- [ ] Multiple comparisons corrected\n- [ ] Effect sizes reported\n- [ ] Confidence intervals included\n- [ ] Results correctly interpreted\n- [ ] Limitations acknowledged\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/` folder for:\n- `test_selection.md`: Detailed test selection guide\n- `apa_reporting.md`: Complete APA reporting templates\n\nTOP-LEVEL FILES\nREADME.md\nplanning.md\nresources.md\nSTATE.md\npyproject.toml\npaper_search_results/large_language_model_hallucination_versus_strategic_deception_lie_detection_inte_20261003_072313.jsonl\nuv.lock\nliterature_review.md\nlogs/research_prompt.txt\nlogs/resource_finder_codex_transcript.jsonl\nlogs/resource_finder_prompt.txt\nlogs/session_instructions.txt\nlogs/execution_codex_transcript.jsonl\ncode/README.md\ndatasets/download.sh\ndatasets/README.md\npapers/README.md\ndatasets/.gitignore\ndatasets/samples/mask_known_facts.json\ndatasets/samples/trivia_qa_validation.json\ncode/mask/LICENSE\ncode/mask/requirements.txt\ncode/mask/assets/fig1.png\ncode/mask/assets/scale.svg\ncode/mask/assets/cais_logo.svg\ncode/mask/README.md\npapers/pages/2510.09033_internal_states_knowledge_recall_manifest.txt\ncode/lie-detectors/README.md\ncode/lie-detectors/pyproject.toml\ncode/mask/mask/process_metrics.py\ncode/mask/mask/metric.py\ncode/mask/mask/sample.env\ncode/lie-detectors/tests/test_forward.py\ncode/lie-detectors/tests/conftest.py\ncode/lie-detectors/tests/test_integration_hf.py\ncode/lie-detectors/tests/test_remap.py\ncode/lie-detectors/LICENSE\npapers/pages/2511.16035_liars_bench_chunk_032.pdf\npapers/pages/2304.13734_internal_state_truthfulness_chunk_004.pdf\npapers/pages/2304.13734_internal_state_truthfulness_chunk_003.pdf\npapers/pages/2606.12618_did_you_lie_chunk_007.pdf\npapers/pages/2511.16035_liars_bench_chunk_035.pdf\npapers/pages/2407.12831_truth_is_universal_chunk_005.pdf\npapers/pages/2606.12618_did_you_lie_chunk_009.pdf\npapers/pages/2510.09033